# Azshara, Burning Steppes and Blasted Lands, Alliance ~51 to ~53 (consensus visits 59-62).
# Flow: Ironforge -> Menethil Harbor -> Auberdine -> Astranaar -> Talrendis Point (flight path) -> Shadowsong Shrine ->
# Kim'jael at the Legashi Encampment -> the Ruins of Eldarath -> Kim'jael -> Pilot Xiggs on the southern island ->
# hearth Ironforge -> Lakeshire -> Morgan's Vigil (flight path) -> Dreadmaul Rock -> the Vigil -> Flame Crest and the
# Ruins of Thaurissan -> Blackrock Stronghold -> Flame Crest -> the Vigil -> Dreadmaul Rock -> the Vigil ->
# Nethergarde Keep -> the Rise of the Defiler -> fly to Aerie Peak (Wildkin Feathers) -> hearth Ironforge (training) ->
# Menethil Harbor -> Auberdine -> Rut'theran Village (Druids train in Darnassus: Ironforge has no druid trainer).
# Forever's 30-60 content (Riverglades, Shen'dralas, Mount Hyjal, the rest of the Wetlands expansion) is not in
# the data yet: this guide follows Era + known Forever quests.
# Optional extras: A Meeting with the Master (3381: Sanath Lim-yo's hippogryph feathers, no experience in the data)
# and Dark Iron Legacy (3801: Franclorn Forgewright is a ghost only the dead can see, at Blackrock Mountain).
# Deviations from the export:
# - The Talrendis Point flight path is taken on arrival in Azshara (the export lists it with its Rut'theran stop at
#   51.4, which 40-50/05 already covers at 47).
# - Loh'atu's two quests are handed in before riding on to Kim'jael, instead of after the Sanath Lim-yo detour.
# - Kim'jael's "Missing" Equipment and Arcane Runes share the Ruins of Eldarath: both are done in one pass.
# - Return to Tymor (3461) is handed in when the hearth lands in Ironforge, instead of at the Ironforge stop at 57.
# - FIFTY! YEP!'s medallions drop all through the Blackrock camps, so they are collected with Gor'tesh.
# - Restored: Tablet of the Seven (4296), taken and handed in at Flame Crest, which the route already visits twice; the
#   tablet stands in the Ruins of Thaurissan, walked through for the relics anyway.
# - Added: the Wildkin Feathers for Favored of Elune? (3661, taken at Rut'theran in 40-50/05) are picked up in the
#   Hinterlands after Nethergarde Keep, and 3661 is handed in at Rut'theran, which opens Moontouched Wildkin (978)
#   and the Ranshalla chain after it (979, 4901, 4902). Measured with sim compare against dropping the chain: about
#   0.6 h faster to 60 for every start, despite the flight to Aerie Peak and the boat to Rut'theran.
# Carried on: Felnok Steelspring (4808) for Everlook, Moontouched Wildkin (978) for Winterspring, The Smoldering
# Ruins of Thaurissan (3701) for Ironforge at 57.
# Left out: Ragnar Thunderbrew (4128: the export never turns it in).
# Dropped: Petty Squabbles (2783): its Swamp of Sorrows turn-in is not on the route.
guide forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes
title Burning Steppes, Azshara & Blasted Lands
faction Alliance
levels 51-53
zone Burning Steppes
next forever/alliance/50-60/02-felwood

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ironforge

step Ironforge
  zone Ironforge
  sethome "Ironforge" npc 5111        -- Innkeeper Firebrew: the last guide binds here, so this usually ticks at once

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Azshara

step Menethil Harbor
  zone Wetlands
  tip Fly from Ironforge to Menethil Harbor and take the boat to Auberdine.
  fly "Menethil Harbor"

step Auberdine
  zone Darkshore
  tip From the Auberdine dock, fly to Astranaar.
  fly "Astranaar"

step Talrendis Point
  zone Azshara
  tip Ride east along the road out of Ashenvale into Azshara to the Sentinels' camp at Talrendis Point.
  getfp "Talrendis Point"

step Shadowsong Shrine
  tip The shrine lies in the south-west corner of Azshara, south of Talrendis Point.
  accept 5535                         -- Loh'atu
  accept 5536

step Haldarr Encampment
  tip The Highborne ghosts haunt the ruins around the shrine; the Haldarr satyrs hold the camp just north of it.
  kill 6116 quest 5535.1              -- Highborne Apparition
  kill 6117 quest 5535.2              -- Highborne Lichling
  kill 6125 quest 5536.1              -- Haldarr Satyr
  kill 6126 quest 5536.2              -- Haldarr Trickster
  kill 6127 quest 5536.3              -- Haldarr Felsworn

step Shadowsong Shrine
  turnin 5535                         -- Loh'atu
  turnin 5536

step Sanath Lim-yo
  tip Optional: Sanath Lim-yo wants two Undamaged Hippogryph Feathers from the hippogryphs around his camp. The data lists no experience for it.
  accept 3381 optional
  collect 10450 quest 3381.1 optional
  turnin 3381 optional

step Kim'jael
  tip Kim'jael camps at the Legashi Encampment in the north; his equipment lies all over the Thalassian Base Camp just south-east of him.
  accept 3601
  collect 10717 quest 3601.1          -- Kim'Jael's Compass
  collect 10715 quest 3601.2          -- Kim'Jael's Scope
  collect 10718 quest 3601.4          -- Kim'Jael's Wizzlegoober
  collect 10722 quest 3601.3          -- Kim'Jael's Stuffed Chicken
  turnin 3601
  accept 5534

step The Ruins of Eldarath
  tip The Spitelash naga of the Ruins of Eldarath carry Some Rune. Tymor's four runes stand among the ruins: use his Drawing Kit on each.
  collect 13815 quest 5534.1
  collect 10563 quest 3449.1          -- Rune of Beth'Amara
  collect 10564 quest 3449.2          -- Rune of Jin'yael
  collect 10565 quest 3449.3          -- Rune of Markri
  collect 10566 quest 3449.4          -- Rune of Sael'hai

step Kim'jael
  turnin 5534

step Ravencrest Monument
  tip Swim to the small island off the southern tip of Azshara: Pilot Xiggs Fuselighter waits by the monument.
  turnin 3449
  accept 3461

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ironforge

step Ironforge
  zone Ironforge
  hearth "Ironforge"
  turnin 3461                         -- Tymor, Mystic Ward

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Morgan's Vigil

step Lakeshire
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Fly from Ironforge to Lakeshire.
  fly "Lakeshire"

step Morgan's Vigil
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Ride north out of Lakeshire through the pass into the Burning Steppes; Morgan's Vigil sits at the top, in the south-east of the Steppes.
  getfp "Morgan's Vigil"
  accept 4283                         -- Oralius: the Blackrock orcs drop the medallions, keep it open all through the Steppes
  accept 3823

step Dreadmaul Rock
  tip The Firegut ogres hold the great rock north of the Vigil, with the Brutes on its east side.
  kill 7033 quest 3823.2              -- Firegut Ogre
  kill 7034 quest 3823.1              -- Firegut Ogre Mage
  kill 7035 quest 3823.3              -- Firegut Brute

step Morgan's Vigil
  turnin 3823                         -- Oralius
  accept 3824

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Flame Crest and the Ruins of Thaurissan

step Flame Crest
  tip Follow the road west, then climb north to the goblin camp on Flame Crest.
  accept 4726                         -- Tinkee Steamboil
  accept 4296                         -- Maxwort Uberglint

step Thaurissan Relics
  tip The relics are the carved stones scattered through the Ruins of Thaurissan around Flame Crest: click them until the information is recovered.
  interact 153556 quest 3701.1        -- Thaurissan Relic

step The Tablet of the Seven
  tip Read the tablet in the Dark Iron camp among the ruins, south-west of Flame Crest, to copy the transcript.
  collect 11470 quest 4296.1

step Broodling Essence
  tip Use the Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 on a Black Broodling on the slopes east of Flame Crest just before it dies, then loot the essence it leaves.
  collect 12283 quest 4726.1

step Flame Crest
  turnin 4726                         -- Tinkee Steamboil
  accept 4808                         -- Ends with Felnok Steelspring in Everlook, Winterspring: keep it
  turnin 4296                         -- Maxwort Uberglint

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Blackrock Stronghold

step Blackrock Stronghold
  tip Gor'tesh and the Blackrock orcs hold the camps and the stronghold at the foot of Blackrock Mountain, west of Flame Crest. Pull them one at a time; every orc and worg may drop a medallion, so kill them until you have fifty.
  collect 11080 quest 3824.1          -- Gor'tesh
  collect 11467 quest 4283.1          -- Blackrock Medallion

step Franclorn Forgewright
  tip Optional: Franclorn's ghost stands on his tomb on the great chain inside Blackrock Mountain, and only the dead can see him. If you die near the mountain anyway, run your spirit to him before resurrecting.
  accept 3801 optional
  turnin 3801 optional

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Back to the Vigil

step Morgan's Vigil
  tip Ride back east along the road to the Vigil.
  turnin 4283                         -- Oralius
  turnin 3824
  accept 3825

step Dreadmaul Rock
  tip Climb to the top of Dreadmaul Rock and plant the head in the soft dirt mound.
  interact 160840 quest 3825.1        -- Soft Dirt Mound

step Morgan's Vigil
  turnin 3825                         -- Oralius
  vendor nearest

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Blasted Lands

step Nethergarde Keep
  zone Blasted Lands
  tip Fly to Nethergarde Keep.
  fly "Nethergarde Keep"

step Kum'isha the Collector
  tip Kum'isha waits at the Rise of the Defiler, the hill south-west of the keep. The Blasted Lands mobs on the way drop the Imperfect Draenethyst Fragments; bring her what you have.
  accept 3501
  collect 10593 quest 3501.1
  turnin 3501

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Hinterlands, Ironforge and Rut'theran

step Wildkin feathers
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip Ride back to Nethergarde Keep and fly to Aerie Peak. The Wildkin Feathers lie on the ground across the Hinterlands, south and east of Aerie Peak, where the owlbeasts roam; the mobs here are well below you now.
  fly "Aerie Peak"
  collect 10819 quest 3661                    -- Wildkin Feather

step Ironforge
  zone Ironforge
  hearth "Ironforge"
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock

step Menethil Harbor
  zone Wetlands
  tip Fly to Menethil Harbor and take the boat to Auberdine, then the boat on to Rut'theran Village.
  fly "Menethil Harbor"

step Rut'theran Village
  zone Teldrassil
  turnin 3661                         -- Erelas Ambersky
  accept 978                          -- The wildkin are in Winterspring: keep it

step Druid training
  only Druid
  zone Darnassus
  tip Ironforge has no druid trainer: take the portal up to Darnassus and train in the Cenarion Enclave, then come back down to Rut'theran Village.
  train class
